<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Halley — 부동산 매물 비교</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@300;500;700&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
    <script defer src="/js/app.js"></script>
    <script defer src="/js/vendor/alpine.min.js"></script>
    {{#kakaoJsKey}}
    <script src="https://dapi.kakao.com/v2/maps/sdk.js?appkey={{kakaoJsKey}}&autoload=false"></script>
    {{/kakaoJsKey}}
</head>
<body x-data="halley()" x-init="init()">

<div class="shell">
    <div class="topbar">
        <div class="topbar-in">
            <a class="wordmark" href="/">Halley</a>
            <template x-if="session.authenticated">
                <nav class="nav">
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='list'}" @click="setView('list')">매물</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='users'}" x-show="session.role==='ADMIN'" @click="setView('users')">사용자</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='weights'}" x-show="session.role==='ADMIN'" @click="setView('weights')">기준</button>
                    <span class="who"><b x-text="session.nickname"></b><span x-text="session.role==='ADMIN' ? ' · 관리자' : ''"></span></span>
                    <button class="btn btn-ghost" @click="logout()">로그아웃</button>
                </nav>
            </template>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main class="main-grid">
        <section class="map-panel">
            <div id="map" class="map-canvas"></div>
            <div class="map-empty" x-show="!session.authenticated || session.mustChangePassword">
                <div class="empty-ic">◌</div>
                <h4>카카오맵 대기 중</h4>
                <p>로그인 후 매물 좌표가 마커로 표시됩니다.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <aside class="list-panel">
            <template x-if="session.authenticated && !session.mustChangePassword">
                <div>
                    <div x-show="view==='list'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">01</span><h2>매물</h2><span class="sec-sub" x-text="properties.length + '건'"></span>
                            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" @click="openAddMenu()">+ 매물 추가</button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="deal-tabs">
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='ALL'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('ALL')">전체</button>
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='SALE'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('SALE')">매매</button>
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='JEONSE'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('JEONSE')">전세</button>
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='MONTHLY'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('MONTHLY')">월세</button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="property-list">
                            <template x-if="properties.length === 0">
                                <div class="empty">
                                    <div class="empty-ic">◌</div>
                                    <h4>아직 등록된 매물이 없습니다</h4>
                                    <p>네이버 매물 상세 텍스트를 붙여넣거나 직접 입력해 첫 매물을 등록해 보세요.</p>
                                    <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="openAddMenu()">+ 매물 추가</button>
                                </div>
                            </template>
                            <template x-for="r in properties" :key="r.property.id">
                                <article class="property-card" :class="{active: activePropertyId === r.property.id}"
                                         :id="'prop-' + r.property.id" @click="focusProperty(r)">
                                    <div class="property-card-header">
                                        <span class="property-card-name" x-text="r.property.name"></span>
                                        <span class="property-card-price" x-text="fmtWon(r.property.priceDeposit)"></span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="property-card-meta">
                                        <span class="badge" :class="dealBadge(r.property.dealType)" x-text="dealLabel(r.property.dealType)"></span>
                                        <span x-text="r.property.addressRoad"></span>
                                        <span x-show="r.property.floorNo" x-text="r.property.floorNo + '층'"></span>
                                        <span x-show="r.property.areaExclusiveM2" x-text="r.property.areaExclusiveM2 + '㎡'"></span>
                                        <span class="score-pill" :class="r.totalScore != null && r.totalScore >= 50 ? 'score-high' : 'score-low'">
                                            <b x-text="fmtScore(r.totalScore)"></b><i>점</i>
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="property-card-actions" @click.stop>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openScoreModal(r)">채점</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openEditProperty(r)">수정</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link danger" @click="removeProperty(r)">삭제</button>
                                    </div>
                                </article>
                            </template>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div x-show="view==='weights'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">03</span><h2>평가 기준·가중치</h2><span class="sec-sub" x-text="weights.length + '개'"></span></div>
                        <div class="card table-wrap">
                            <table>
                                <thead>
                                <tr><th>순위</th><th>기준</th><th>유형</th><th>가중치</th><th>이동</th></tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                <template x-for="(w, i) in weights" :key="w.criterionCode">
                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="num" x-text="i + 1"></td>
                                        <td class="strong" x-text="w.name"></td>
                                        <td>
                                            <span class="badge" :class="w.scoringType==='AUTO' ? 'b-mem' : 'b-admin'"
                                                  x-text="w.scoringType==='AUTO' ? '자동' : '수동'"></span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="num" x-text="w.weight"></td>
                                        <td>
                                            <button class="btn-link" @click="moveWeight(i, -1)" :disabled="i === 0">↑</button>
                                            <button class="btn-link" @click="moveWeight(i, 1)" :disabled="i === weights.length - 1">↓</button>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </template>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                        <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="saveWeights()" :disabled="loading">
                            <span x-text="loading ? '저장 중…' : '가중치 저장'"></span>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <div x-show="view==='users'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">02</span><h2>사용자 관리</h2><span class="sec-sub" x-text="users.length + '명'"></span></div>
                        <div class="card table-wrap">
                            <table>
                                <thead>
                                <tr><th>닉네임</th><th>이메일</th><th>역할</th><th>가용 예산</th><th>상태</th></tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                <template x-for="u in users" :key="u.id">
                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="strong" x-text="u.nickname"></td>
                                        <td x-text="u.email"></td>
                                        <td><span class="badge" :class="u.role==='ADMIN' ? 'b-admin' : 'b-mem'" x-text="u.role==='ADMIN' ? '관리자' : '회원'"></span></td>
                                        <td class="num" x-text="fmtWon(u.availableBudget)"></td>
                                        <td><span class="badge" :class="u.enabled ? 'b-on' : 'b-off'" x-text="u.enabled ? '활성' : '비활성'"></span></td>
                                    </tr>
                                </template>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </template>
        </aside>
    </main>
</div>

<!-- D1 로그인 모달 -->
<div class="modal" x-show="showLogin" x-cloak>
    <div class="modal-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="modal-card">
        <div class="modal-head">
            <span class="modal-kicker">Halley · 로그인</span>
            <h3>부동산 매물 비교</h3>
            <p>계정 정보를 입력해 들어오세요.</p>
        </div>
        <form class="form" @submit.prevent="login()">
            <label>아이디
                <input type="text" x-model="loginForm.email" autocomplete="username" placeholder="admin" required>
            </label>
            <label>비밀번호
                <input type="password" x-model="loginForm.password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="••••••••" required>
            </label>
            <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit" :disabled="loading">
                <span x-text="loading ? '로그인 중…' : '로그인'"></span>
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- D2 비밀번호 강제 변경 모달 -->
<div class="modal" x-show="showPassword" x-cloak>
    <div class="modal-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="modal-card">
        <div class="modal-head">
            <span class="modal-kicker">보안</span>
            <h3>비밀번호 변경</h3>
            <p>최초 로그인 또는 임시 비밀번호로 접속하셨습니다. 새 비밀번호를 설정해야 계속할 수 있습니다.</p>
        </div>
        <form class="form" @submit.prevent="changePassword()">
            <label>현재 비밀번호
                <input type="password" x-model="passwordForm.currentPassword" autocomplete="current-password" required>
            </label>
            <label>새 비밀번호
                <input type="password" x-model="passwordForm.newPassword" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" required>
            </label>
            <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit" :disabled="loading">
                <span x-text="loading ? '변경 중…' : '비밀번호 변경'"></span>
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- D8 등록 방식 선택 모달 -->
<div class="modal" x-show="showAddMenu" x-cloak>
    <div class="modal-backdrop" @click="closeAddMenu()"></div>
    <div class="modal-card">
        <div class="modal-head">
            <span class="modal-kicker">매물 등록</span>
            <h3>등록 방식 선택</h3>
            <p>네이버 매물 상세 텍스트를 붙여넣거나 직접 입력하세요.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="add-choices">
            <button class="add-choice" @click="openPasteModal()">
                <b>붙여넣기로 등록</b>
                <span>네이버 매물 상세 텍스트를 복사해 붙여넣으면 자동 파싱됩니다.</span>
            </button>
            <button class="add-choice" @click="startManual()">
                <b>직접 입력</b>
                <span>빈 폼에 직접 입력합니다.</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- D9 붙여넣기 등록 모달 -->
<div class="modal" x-show="showPasteModal" x-cloak>
    <div class="modal-backdrop" @click="closePasteModal()"></div>
    <div class="modal-card modal-wide modal-tall">
        <div class="modal-head">
            <span class="modal-kicker">붙여넣기 등록</span>
            <h3 x-text="pastePreview ? '파싱 프리뷰' : '네이버 매물 상세 붙여넣기'"></h3>
            <p>네이버 부동산 매물 상세에서 전체 선택 → 복사 → 여기에 붙여넣으세요.</p>
        </div>
        <template x-if="!pastePreview">
            <div class="paste-step">
                <textarea id="pasteText" class="paste-textarea" x-model="pasteText"
                          @input="onPasteInput()" placeholder="매매&#10;매매가&#10;15억&#10;전용면적&#10;84.98㎡&#10;…"></textarea>
                <p class="paste-hint" x-show="pasteParsing">파싱 중…</p>
                <p class="form-error" x-show="pasteError && !pastePreview" x-text="pasteError"></p>
                <button class="btn btn-ghost" @click="closePasteModal()">닫기</button>
            </div>
        </template>
        <template x-if="pastePreview">
            <div class="paste-step">
                <p class="paste-warn" x-show="!pastePreview.isListing">네이버 매물 상세 텍스트가 아닌 것 같습니다. 직접 입력을 이용하세요.</p>
                <div class="paste-grid">
                    <template x-for="f in pastePreview.fields" :key="f.key">
                        <label class="paste-field" :class="'c-' + f.confidence">
                            <span class="paste-field-head">
                                <b x-text="fieldLabel(f.key)"></b>
                                <span class="badge" :class="f.confidence==='EXACT' ? 'b-on' : (f.confidence==='DERIVED' ? 'b-jeonse' : 'b-off')"
                                      x-text="confidenceLabel(f.confidence)"></span>
                            </span>
                            <input type="text" x-model="pasteForm[f.key]" :placeholder="f.confidence==='MISSING' ? '직접 입력' : ''">
                            <span class="paste-note" x-show="f.note" x-text="f.note"></span>
                        </label>
                    </template>
                </div>
                <p class="form-error" x-show="pasteError" x-text="pasteError"></p>
                <div class="paste-actions">
                    <button class="btn btn-ghost" @click="pastePreview=null; pasteForm={}">다시 입력</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="savePaste()" :disabled="pasteParsing">
                        <span x-text="pasteParsing ? '등록 중…' : '매물 등록'"></span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </template>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- D10 매물 수기 등록/수정 모달 -->
<div class="modal" x-show="showPropertyForm" x-cloak>
    <div class="modal-backdrop" @click="closePropertyForm()"></div>
    <div class="modal-card modal-wide">
        <div class="modal-head">
            <span class="modal-kicker">매물 등록</span>
            <h3 x-text="propertyForm.id ? '매물 수정' : '매물 수기 등록'"></h3>
            <p>네이버 붙여넣기 등록은 추후 제공됩니다. 지금은 핵심 정보를 직접 입력하세요.</p>
        </div>
        <form class="form" @submit.prevent="saveProperty()">
            <div class="form-grid">
                <label class="span2">매물명
                    <input type="text" x-model="propertyForm.name" placeholder="예: 한빛아파트" required>
                </label>
                <label>거래유형
                    <select x-model="propertyForm.dealType">
                        <option value="SALE">매매</option>
                        <option value="JEONSE">전세</option>
                        <option value="MONTHLY">월세</option>
                    </select>
                </label>
                <label>보증금/매매가 (원)
                    <input type="number" min="0" x-model="propertyForm.priceDeposit" placeholder="550000000">
                </label>
                <label>월세 (원)
                    <input type="number" min="0" x-model="propertyForm.priceMonthly" placeholder="0">
                </label>
                <label>관리비 (원/월)
                    <input type="number" min="0" x-model="propertyForm.maintenanceFee" placeholder="0">
                </label>
                <label class="span2">도로명주소
                    <input type="text" x-model="propertyForm.addressRoad" placeholder="서울시 ...">
                </label>
                <label>위도
                    <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="propertyForm.lat" placeholder="37.5">
                </label>
                <label>경도
                    <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="propertyForm.lng" placeholder="127.0">
                </label>
                <label>전용면적 (㎡)
                    <input type="number" step="0.01" min="0" x-model="propertyForm.areaExclusiveM2" placeholder="84.9">
                </label>
                <label>공급면적 (㎡)
                    <input type="number" step="0.01" min="0" x-model="propertyForm.areaSupplyM2" placeholder="112.0">
                </label>
                <label>층
                    <input type="number" min="1" x-model="propertyForm.floorNo" placeholder="5">
                </label>
                <label>총 층수
                    <input type="number" min="1" x-model="propertyForm.floorTotal" placeholder="12">
                </label>
                <label>향
                    <input type="text" x-model="propertyForm.direction" placeholder="남향">
                </label>
                <label>준공년도
                    <input type="number" min="1900" x-model="propertyForm.approvalYear" placeholder="2018">
                </label>
                <label>건물동수
                    <input type="number" min="1" x-model="propertyForm.buildingCount" placeholder="3">
                </label>
                <label>총세대수
                    <input type="number" min="1" x-model="propertyForm.totalHouseholds" placeholder="300">
                </label>
                <label>입주가능
                    <select x-model="propertyForm.moveInType">
                        <option value="">선택 안 함</option>
                        <option value="IMMEDIATE">즉시 입주</option>
                        <option value="NEGOTIABLE">협의</option>
                        <option value="DATE">날짜 지정</option>
                    </select>
                </label>
                <label>입주가능일
                    <input type="date" x-model="propertyForm.moveInDate">
                </label>
            </div>
            <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit" :disabled="loading">
                <span x-text="loading ? '저장 중…' : (propertyForm.id ? '저장' : '등록')"></span>
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- D14 평가 채점 모달 -->
<div class="modal" x-show="showScoreModal" x-cloak>
    <div class="modal-backdrop" @click="closeScoreModal()"></div>
    <div class="modal-card modal-wide">
        <div class="modal-head">
            <span class="modal-kicker">평가 채점</span>
            <h3 x-text="scoreProperty.property.name"></h3>
            <p>항목별 수동 점수를 입력하면 자동 점수를 덮어씁니다. 쾌적함은 사용자별 1~5로 평가합니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="score-list">
            <template x-for="s in scoreProperty.scores" :key="s.code">
                <label class="score-row">
                    <span class="score-name">
                        <b x-text="s.name"></b>
                        <span class="score-source" x-text="scoreSourceLabel(s.scoreSource)"></span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="score-auto" x-text="'유효 ' + fmtScore(s.effectiveScore)"></span>
                    <input type="number" x-model="scoreForm[s.code]"
                           :min="s.code === 'COMFORT' ? 1 : 0"
                           :max="s.code === 'COMFORT' ? 5 : 100"
                           :placeholder="s.code === 'COMFORT' ? '1~5' : '0~100'">
                </label>
            </template>
        </div>
        <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" @click="saveScore()" :disabled="loading">
            <span x-text="loading ? '저장 중…' : '채점 저장'"></span>
        </button>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- D23 로드뷰 모달 -->
<div class="modal modal-roadview" x-show="showRoadview" x-cloak>
    <div id="roadview" class="rv-canvas"></div>
    <div class="rv-fallback" x-show="roadviewState === 'missing'">
        <div class="empty-ic">◌</div>
        <h4>이 위치는 로드뷰가 제공되지 않습니다</h4>
        <p>신축 단지나 골목 안쪽은 로드뷰가 없을 수 있습니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rv-top" x-show="roadviewProperty">
        <div class="rv-info">
            <span class="rv-name" x-text="roadviewProperty.name"></span>
            <span class="rv-meta">
                <span class="badge" :class="dealBadge(roadviewProperty.dealType)" x-text="dealLabel(roadviewProperty.dealType)"></span>
                <span x-text="fmtWon(roadviewProperty.priceDeposit)"></span>
            </span>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" @click="closeRoadview()">닫기</button>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
